        <body>
            <div xml:id="d256">

                <pb facs="0298" n="216" sameAs="frus:frus1911/pg216"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 20437/107.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the American
                        Ambassador.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1910-07-05"><hi rendition="#italic">July 5,
                        1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The Department will not recommend a conference on the basis of your telegram of
                    July 1. The three conditions therein stated appear to conflict with official
                    assurances made to you upon passage of the law. See your telegram of May 12.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
